File: apps/engine.c
Line: 402
Function: engine_main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The BIO pointer 'out' is obtained at line 318 via dup_bio_out(FORMAT_TEXT) without checking for failure. If dup_bio_out returns NULL (e.g., due to allocation failure), the subsequent use at line 402 in BIO_printf(out, ...) will dereference a NULL pointer, causing a crash.

